            "block_content": "(d) As long as the participants remain eligible for Extended Compensation Payments, the Company agrees to render weekly compensation for a period of time not to exceed the number of weeks provided for in the termination schedule of their former position's collective bargaining agreement or the Optional Termination Pay schedule as determined above.",
